{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore","doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/testkitcore\/performanceoptions\/cputimelimit"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions\/cpuTimeLimit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit Core"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11TestKitCore18PerformanceOptionsV12cpuTimeLimits8DurationVSgvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cpuTimeLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"cpuTimeLimit"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The CPU time limit."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cpuTimeLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default value is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" (CPU time measurement disabled). When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"non-","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", the test fails if the median CPU time across measurement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs exceeds this limit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CPU time measures only the time during which the process was actually","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executing on a CPU core.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CPU time is measured at process granularity, and is not scoped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the measured block. When tests run in parallel within a single"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process, the CPU time consumed by other concurrently-executing tests is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"included in the measurement. For reliable CPU time assertions, run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tests serially or in isolation."}]}],"style":"note"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CPU time is the incorrect measurement for I\/O-bound or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lock-contended code, since the time spent blocked does not advance the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CPU clock. Use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions\/wallTimeLimit","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead, or use both limits together."}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"references":{"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore/PerformanceOptions":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PerformanceOptions"}],"url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore\/performanceoptions","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PerformanceOptions"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The options for performance testing."}],"title":"PerformanceOptions","role":"symbol"},"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore/PerformanceOptions/wallTimeLimit":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions\/wallTimeLimit","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"wallTimeLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore\/performanceoptions\/walltimelimit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"wallTimeLimit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time limit."}]},"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore/PerformanceOptions/cpuTimeLimit":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/PerformanceOptions\/cpuTimeLimit","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cpuTimeLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore\/performanceoptions\/cputimelimit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"cpuTimeLimit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The CPU time limit."}]},"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core types shared by SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit."}],"title":"SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit Core"}}}